{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Precision-driven arrow combat</strong> \u2014 skill-based shooting where accuracy matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose powerful passive spells</strong> that grant bonuses and enhancements during each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rogue-lite progression</strong> with soldier leveling and meta upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple modes, including a hands-off AFK mode</strong> for idle play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Direct your soldiers on the fly</strong> as they hold the line and defend the shrine </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Blend of arrow shooting and army management with rogue-lite depth.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this fast-paced action game, you\u2019ll need sharp aim and quick reflexes to survive waves of enemies. Every shot matters, master your bow to pierce through ever-tougher foes as the sun sets and the night grows deadlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/05125-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1748713378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Auto Battler Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eendless mode where you can take a break a let your units do the work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/05291-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1748713378\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/Untitled-2.png?t=1748713378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not alone. <strong>Recruit various unit types</strong> and command a supporting army of soldiers who fight at your side. Level them up, boost their strength and equip them with <strong>powerful items</strong> to customize their roles and turn the tide when things get overwhelming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/level_picker.png?t=1748713378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/Untitled-3.png?t=1748713378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade an arsenal of passive spells, damage boosts, and unit upgrades. Experiment with new strategies on every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/vlcsnap-2025-05-04-16h25m23s150.png?t=1748713378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/Untitled-4.png?t=1748713378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features multiple modes \u2014 tackle the challenge in a hands-on Active mode or switch to AFK mode to let your army fight on its own. Adjust the difficulty (Easy/Medium/Hard) to suit your preferred playstyle, from casual defense to hardcore survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/levels.png?t=1748713378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3679750?t=1748713378","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/3680acea0bf905bbec2d808b68639c8967b210d1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748713378","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/921d052fda9585d88c06a25792f18d254089cbc5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748713378","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/921d052fda9585d88c06a25792f18d254089cbc5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748713378","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Play the demo</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/wishlist.png?t=1748713378\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Precision-driven arrow combat</strong> \u2014 skill-based shooting where accuracy matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose powerful passive spells</strong> that grant bonuses and enhancements during each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rogue-lite progression</strong> with soldier leveling and meta upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple modes, including a hands-off AFK mode</strong> for idle play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Direct your soldiers on the fly</strong> as they hold the line and defend the shrine </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Blend of arrow shooting and army management with rogue-lite depth.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this fast-paced action game, you\u2019ll need sharp aim and quick reflexes to survive waves of enemies. Every shot matters, master your bow to pierce through ever-tougher foes as the sun sets and the night grows deadlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/05125-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1748713378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Auto Battler Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eendless mode where you can take a break a let your units do the work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/05291-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1748713378\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/Untitled-2.png?t=1748713378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not alone. <strong>Recruit various unit types</strong> and command a supporting army of soldiers who fight at your side. Level them up, boost their strength and equip them with <strong>powerful items</strong> to customize their roles and turn the tide when things get overwhelming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/level_picker.png?t=1748713378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/Untitled-3.png?t=1748713378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade an arsenal of passive spells, damage boosts, and unit upgrades. Experiment with new strategies on every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/vlcsnap-2025-05-04-16h25m23s150.png?t=1748713378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/Untitled-4.png?t=1748713378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features multiple modes \u2014 tackle the challenge in a hands-on Active mode or switch to AFK mode to let your army fight on its own. Adjust the difficulty (Easy/Medium/Hard) to suit your preferred playstyle, from casual defense to hardcore survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/levels.png?t=1748713378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["VSolStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/caa0bf3b73a10651129d7c9b7e1cd52810d0b57d/header.jpg?t=1748713378","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257135848,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135848/movie480.mp4?t=1746720231","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135848/movie_max.mp4?t=1746720231"},"name":"Annouce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257135848/4f1490c9b6bcc631aa327581d35eb3c120aef7c1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746720231","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135848/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746720231","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135848/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746720231"}}],"name":"Shrine Protectors","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4  GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  128MB, OpenGL 3+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["VSolStudio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","u